 for your next fights ! <br>Some resources you’ll find on the road could be super useful at the saloon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>It’s up to you to write your own legend by building your perfect barrel.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>In Barrel Roll you'll find...</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >64 <strong><u>bullets</u></strong> with powerful effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 <strong><u>trinkets</u></strong> to change the way you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 <u><strong>skills</strong></u> to get out of every situation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 <strong><u>bosses</u></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5 <strong><u>Threat level</u></strong> to make sure you won't stand a chance to beat BARREL ROLL </p></li></ul>",
